## Rules

- `ok` means the static scan succeeded, not that the DNA is approved or the design is original.
- Blocked rows stay visible until resolved or removed by the operator.
- Raw HTML/CSS lives in `.work.ui/tmp/reference-scan/` only; it is never tracked.
- No assets, logos, fonts, or copy are licensed by being listed here.

